{
  "id": "DAN.6",
  "number": "6",
  "bookId": "DAN",
  "reference": "Danieli 6",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DAN 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Danieli okobekwa ase engoro ye chindo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dario akarora ng’a mbuya abeeke abagaambi abanene b’oborwoti rigana erimo, na emerongo ebere, babe bakogaamba ase oborwoti bwaye bwonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende akabeeka abanene batato igoro ase abwo; Danieli nigo arenge oyomo obo. Abagaambi baria abanene nigo barenge koba bakorua omobaro ase abwo batato, erinde omorwoti tabaisa gosirerwa n’eniibo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Danieli akamanyekana kobua abanene baria bande, na kobua abagaambi baria abanene, ekiagera abwate omoika omuya mono ime yaye; na omorwoti akarengereria komobeka igoro y’oborwoti bwonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abanene baria na abagaambi baria abanene bakarigia banyore okomocha ase okogaamba kwa Danieli, erinde bagende komosoera, korende tibanyorete kende gionsi ekebe, gose okomocha ase are, ekiagera ere nigo arenge omwegenwa; okomocha gose gento kende ekebe tibianyorekanete ase are.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abanto abwo bagateebania, “Titokonyara konyora okomocha konde gwonsi ase Danieli okwo torabwatererie tomosoere, otatiga torarigie okomocha kobwatekana buna amoirogete Nyasae oye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaanene baria bande, na abagaambi baria abanene bakabwatana amo, bakagenda ase omorwoti, bakamoteebia, “Aye omorwoti Dario, ochie kare!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaanene bonsi b’oborwoti, na abagaambi bonsi be chingongo, na abagaambi baria abanene, na abasemia, na abagabana, bancheranire ng’a aye omorwoti obeke richiiko na okaane bokong’u ng’a monto onde bwensi tabaisa gosaba enyasae ende yonsi, gose omonto onde, otatiga aye bweka aye omorwoti, ase engaki y’amatuko emerongo etato. Aise gokora ayio, rirorio arutwe ase engoro ye chindo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono aye omorwoti, beka richiiko erio na orikong’ie, naende oribeke ekemanyererio kiao, erinde tiribaisa koonchorwa, koreng’ana buna amachiiko y’Abamedi na Abaayemi atari koonchorwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio Dario omorwoti akabeeka ekemanyererio kiaye ase amariiko e richiiko riria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Danieli amanyete ng’a amariiko ye richiiko riria abekirwe ekemanyererio, akagenda nyomba mwaye, akariina gochia ase akanyomba ka irongo ase chitirisa chiaigoire kororia Yerusalemu, akaba ogotung’ama ara gatato ase kera rituko, akaba ogosaba na goakera Nyasae oye ng’a mbuya mono, buna anarete botambe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono abanto baria bagatubokera Danieli amo, bakamonyora ogosaba okorangeria Nyasae oye amokonye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto baria bakagenda ase omorwoti, bakamobooria igoro ye richiiko riria: “Aye omorwoti, Inee! Tikwabeka ekemanyererio kiao ase richiiko riria, ogateeba ng’a ase engaki y’amatuko emerongo etato monto onde bwensi orasasiime enyasae ende eng’ao, gose omonto onde, otatiga aye bweka aye omorwoti, oyio arutwe ase engoro ye chindo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti akairaneria, “Ee, richiiko erio nigo riteneine bokong’u ritaonchorwe, koreng’ana buna amachiiko y’Abamedi na Abaayemi atari koonchorwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio bakairaneria, bakamoteebia, “Aye omorwoti, Danieli, oria oyomo bw’Abayuda baria boosetwe, ere tari gokoigwera, gose koigwera richiiko riria kwabegete ekemanyererio kiao, korende nigo agokora ogosaba kwaye botambe ara gatato kera rituko.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero omorwoti aigwete amang’ana aria, agachandeka mono, akarigia enchera y’ogotooria Danieli. Goika ekero erioba korikogwa akaba ogendererete korigia enchera y’okomotooria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende abanto baria bagatubokera omorwoti bare amo, bakamoteebia, “Aye omorwoti, manya ng’a amachiiko y’Abamedi na Abaayemi naya, ng’a ogochika konde gwonsi omorwoti abekire na kogokong’ia tigokoonchorwa nonya ng’ake.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omorwoti akarua ogochika ng’a Danieli arentwe. Danieli akarentwa, akarutwa ase engoro ye chindo. Omorwoti agateebia Danieli, “Nyasae oo, oria ogokorera botambe nagotoorie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rigena rikarentwa rigakuneka ase omonwa bw’engoro eria, erio omorwoti akabeeka ekemanyererio kiaye omonyene amo nebi’abanene b’oborwoti bwaye, erinde amang’ana ande onsi Danieli akoreretwe taonchorwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omorwoti akairana, akagenda nyomba mwaye, akeng’ata ase obotuko boria bwonsi. Tancha chigosori na kogokerwa konde gwonsi bikorwe, ne chitoro chikamobora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mambia kobogokiamoka omorwoti akaimoka akaayerera gochia ase engoro eria ye chindo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero aigete ang’e nengoro eria ase Danieli arutetwe, akarangeria neriogi ri’omoichano, akaboria Danieli, “Aye Danieli, omosomba o Nyasae ore moyo, Inee, Nyasae oo, oria ogokorera botambe, ogotooririe korwa ase chindo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Danieli akairaneria omorwoti, “Aye omorwoti, ochie kare!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasae one natomete omomalaika oye, agasieka emenwa ye chindo, na chirochio tichiankorerete bobe bonde, ekiagera nigo nanyorekanete ng’a tindi na komocha ase obosio bwaye; naboigo nase obosio bwao, aye omorwoti, tinkoreti komocha konde.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti akaba nomogooko omonene mono, agachiika ng’a Danieli arusigwe ase engoro eria. Ase ayio Danieli akarusigwa aroro na tanyorekanete oarire aande onsi ase omobere oye, ekiagera nigo amosemeretie Nyasae oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omorwoti agachiika ng’a abanto baria basoerete Danieli barentwe. Erio bakarutwa ase engoro eria ye chindo, barabwo amo n’abana babo, na abakungu babo, na ekero bataragwa gochia inse y’engoro eria, chindo chiria chikabaumokera, chikabuna‐buna amauga onsi y’emebere yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma y’ayio Dario omorwoti akariika amang’ana, akayatoma ase abanto bonsi, na ebisaku, na abanto b’emenwa ao ao, bamenyete ase ense yonsi, akabateebia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Omorembe omentekane ase more:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono narure ogochika ng’a abanto bonsi bare ase oborwoti bwane baiguswe na koiroka ase obosio bwa Nyasae o Danieli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Ere nere Nyasae ore moyo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "nigo areo goika kare na kare;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.26"
            ]
